# Stash Ultimate Availability Check v4.2 manual fix
# Normalized status logic based on iqiancheng.github.io/posts/stash-availability-check-tiles/
# Generated: 2026-10-05
#
# Normalized status vocabulary:
#   Available (XX) = available, region/country extracted
#   Available      = available, region unknown
#   N/A / Not Available = current egress IP does not support the service
#   Blocked        = service explicitly rejects the egress IP/region
#   Network Error  = network failure / timeout / unrecognized transport failure
# Netflix keeps its native unlock levels:
#   No Restriction (XX) = full Netflix catalogue unlocked
#   Originals Only (XX) = Netflix Originals only

name: "🌐 Ultimate Availability Check v4.2 Manual Fix"
desc: "AI / 流媒体 / 出口地区综合检测（15项・统一状态）"

